OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Ainjured woman dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a woman in her
OL,8,F70s.
OL,10,FHertfordshire Police were called to a
OL,11,Fconcern for welfare at Armour Rise in
OL,12,FHitchin at 15:15 BST on Tuesday and
OL,13,Ffound the woman had suffered serious
OL,14,Finjuries.
OL,16,FShe was pronounced dead at the scene
OL,17,Fdespite the efforts of emergency
OL,18,Fservices.
