OL,4,Ainjured woman dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouglas Hardy, 59, who lives in the
OL,7,Fstreet, has been charged with murder
OL,8,Fand is scheduled to appear at Hatfield
OL,9,FRemand Court later.
